KWin-Streaming
==============
Experimental KDE Wayland desktop setup for multi-GPU streaming workstations.

Status: work in progress. The desktop is still being built. No runtime
stability, OBS capture performance, or per-output GPU assignment is verified.
Do not treat this repository as a ready-to-run installer.

AI maintenance disclosure
-------------------------
I know some people dislike AI-maintained code. I need this working yesterday,
so here we are.

Full disclosure: AI tools maintain this fork and its setup scripts. I don't
personally read or review the code. I test the resulting setup on my own
hardware, but that does not replace human code review.

Most of the code comes from KDE and the original experimental branch. Their
authors deserve credit for that work. This project is experimental, and
successful builds should not be taken as proof of stability.

